# cold
# gh#184, the view while the next stroke runs: Undo pressed while a stroke drains waits for it, then runs; the next press (held behind
# it) starts its stroke at once, and the stroke thread owns the mesh, so the frame's sync is skipped (App::syncScene). The GPU must
# not keep showing the undone stroke until that stroke's first batch is uploaded. (SF_DAB_DELAY_MS slows the stroke thread; ctest
# sets it with SF_BACKGROUND_DABS: both are read once at startup.)
run ui_look look=classic layout=classic
run new_sphere subdivisions=6
interactive_strokes on
camera 0 0
key f
wait_idle 30
click "Inflate##brush.inflate"
brush_size 80
# An earlier stroke stays, and the view is marked with it.
stroke 0.30 0.30 0.40 0.70 0.5
wait_idle 30
wait_value stroke_draining == 0 30
wait_real 1
wait 0.3
wait_idle 30
mark_view
expect_value view_vs_mark < 0.01

# S, settled: the view differs from the mark; undone, it is the mark again.
stroke 0.45 0.35 0.70 0.65 0.5
wait_idle 30
wait_value stroke_draining == 0 30
wait_real 1
wait 0.3
wait_idle 30
print view_vs_mark
remember view_vs_mark with_s
# (S's view, for view_nearer_mark at the end.)
mark_view other
expect_value view_vs_mark > 0.02
key ctrl+z
wait_idle 30
wait 0.3
wait_idle 30
expect_value view_vs_mark < 0.01

# S again, released and still draining: Undo and a far-away press wait behind it. Once the undo has run (the redo step exists), the
# far stroke is on the stroke thread: the view meanwhile is the mark's, not S's. A stroke running shades the whole model a little
# differently (0.0595 of S's 0.1145 on GitHub's llvmpipe runners, wherever the far stroke lands), so the distance to the mark alone
# can't be bounded below half of S's difference: the view must be nearer the mark than S's view (S still shown is the other way
# round by all of S's difference).
stroke 0.45 0.35 0.70 0.65 0.5 hold
wait 0.2
release
expect_value stroke_draining == 1
key ctrl+z
stroke 0.10 0.12 0.12 0.14 0.5
wait_value can_redo == 1 30
expect_value stroke_draining == 1
print view_vs_mark
print view_nearer_mark
expect_value view_nearer_mark > 0.0
shot undo-then-stroke-busy
